                    new Outcome("\"결국 돈 때문\"이라는 말이 퍼집니다.\u001FPeople say \"it was about money after all.\"").C(StatId.Reputation, -6)).With(PersonalStatId.Integrity))),
        CultEvent.Conditional("mv10", c => c[StatId.Reputation].Value <= 300, new Question("올해의 \"가장 바보 같은 교단\" 투표에서 1위를 했지만, 댓글란은 이상하게도 응원으로 가득합니다.\u001FYou won first place in the \"Most Foolish Cult of the Year\" poll, yet the comments are strangely full of support.",
