                    new Outcome("귀족들의 방해로 일이 무산되고 당신은 위협받습니다.\u001FNobles sabotage the work, and you are threatened.").C(StatId.Authority, -6).P(PersonalStatId.Health, -3)).With(PersonalStatId.Integrity),
                new Choice("교단 계율만 지키겠다며 사양합니다\u001FDecline, keeping only your own precepts", new Outcome("사절은 아쉬워하지만 존중을 표합니다.\u001FThe envoy is disappointed but shows respect.").P(PersonalStatId.Integrity, 2).C(StatId.FollowerFaith, 3)))),
