                new Choice("교단을 물려준다\u001FHand over the cult", new Outcome("당신은 지팡이를 후계자에게 건네고 거울 앞을 떠납니다.\u001FYou pass your staff to a successor and walk away from the mirror.").C(StatId.Communion, 2).P(PersonalStatId.Charity, 2)),
                new Choice("죽을 때까지 교단을 지킨다\u001FKeep the cult until death", new Outcome("당신은 마지막 숨까지 교주로 남기로 합니다.\u001FYou resolve to remain leader until your last breath.").C(StatId.Authority, 5).P(PersonalStatId.Ambition, 2)))),
    };

